{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29573","headline":"和友人戏赠二首 一 · 李商隐","name":"和友人戏赠二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东望花楼会不同，西来双燕信休通。\n仙人掌冷三霄露，玉女窗虚五夜风。\n翠袖自随回雪转，烛房寻类外庭空。\n殷勤莫使清香透，牢合金鱼鏁桂丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}